Feature: Shared steps for the Haven & Pine booking journey

StepSet: Search for a two-night stay
    Given I open the Haven & Pine home page
    When I choose a check-in date 14 days from today
    And I choose a check-out date 16 days from today
    And I search for available rooms
    Then I should see "Choose your room"

StepSet: Choose the Garden Queen with breakfast
    When I select the "Garden Queen" room
    And I choose the "Morning Ritual" package and continue
    Then the booking summary should show the "Morning Ritual" package

StepSet: Fill in the lead guest details
    When I fill in the lead guest details
      | Title        | Ms                          |
      | First name   | Ada                         |
      | Last name    | Lovelace                    |
      | Email        | ada-{unique:id}@example.com |
      | Country      | Germany                     |
      | Arrival time | After 18:00                 |
    Then the lead guest email should show "ada-{unique:id}@example.com"

StepSet: Pay with the demo card
    When I enter the card number "{data:cards.success}" in the secure payment form
    And I enter the expiry "12/30", CVV "123" and cardholder "Ada Lovelace" in the secure payment form
    And I validate the card
    Then the payment status should show "approved"

StepSet: Sign in as the member
    When I sign in with email "{data:member.email}" and password "{env:DEMO_MEMBER_PASSWORD}"
    Then the header should show "Pine Circle"
